Next time, we switch to security. How can a

69
00:03:43,174 --> 00:03:46,584
website check your password without keeping a copy of

70
00:03:46,584 --> 00:03:49,995
it? If this helped, subscribe, and comment with the

71
00:03:49,995 --> 00:03:53,405
concept you want explained next. See you in the

72
